      "fill": "gray",
      "text": "The code is just the server's https address, so any phone camera opens the web client and CCM's scanner fills the address. It grants no access. Scanning always leads to step 3 'Server found' before credentials. The QR code shown is an illustration and is not scannable. Spec: docs/design/invite-codes.md."
